  "notes": "Dark navy MUI theme (MyFin Budget). Rows alternate background shades (#1f2d3d vs #253649); some row dates are bold white, others dimmed grey. Flow column shows from/to accounts with left/right arrow icons and account-type icons. Description cell stacks the title over category + entity icon-text pairs and optional outlined tag chips ('tax-deductible'). Values are outlined light-blue pill chips. Essential transactions carry a star icon button under the date with a hover tooltip. Edit opens a modal edit form (verified live; not part of capture). Sidebar collapses to an icon rail via hamburger. Meta nav item has a nested submenu (Categories, Entities, Tags, Rules). DataGrid column menu (Filter / Hide column / Manage columns) is revealed on header hover."
